---
source: tui/src/bottom_pane/approval_overlay.rs
expression: "format!(\"{buf:?}\")"
---
Buffer {
    area: Rect { x: 0, y: 0, width: 100, height: 12 },
    content: [
        "                                                                                                    ",
        "  Allow network access to example.com?                                                              ",
        "                                                                                                    ",
        "  Reason: network request blocked                                                                   ",
        "                                                                                                    ",
        "                                                                                                    ",
        "› 1. Allow once (y)                        Runs this action once.                                   ",
        "  2. Allow this host for this session (a)  Allows matching actions for this session.                ",
        "  3. Always allow this host (p)            Saves an allow rule for this host.                       ",
